Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:57.13,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(165,80.333)} Chapter #1
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:57.13,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(177.743,352.667)}Great disovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:57.13,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(504.301,353)}"Kiteretsu Encyclopedia"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.13,0:02:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,1903, December 11
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.13,0:02:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In North Carolina, USA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.13,0:02:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,For the very first time, Mankind succeeded in flight using engine-powered airplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.61,0:02:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you must very well know already that the Wright Brothers invented airplane, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Eiichi-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Eiichi-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.65,0:02:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,20 years before it, using glider a man leapt into the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Otto Lilienthal, he's been said to flew in his glider around 2000 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.03,0:02:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go out and pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a man who used glider, 32 years before Lilienthal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You were paying attention to what I taught, Kite?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.01,0:02:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us who's that, Kiteretsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Kite Kiteretsu Sai, a Japanese man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.39,0:02:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiteretsu Sai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.69,0:03:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ansei year 6 or1859, From the top of a mountain, he flew for about 6 KM and surprised the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to explain to us, who is this Kiteretsu Sai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.57,0:03:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. He's my ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sleep-talk about your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But I mean it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.99,0:03:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiteretsu, maybe you should test what's wrong on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something wrong in your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll know I was right...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then are you going to fly in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.57,0:03:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Miyo-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.57,0:03:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Eiichi-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,About my ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.35,0:03:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:04:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But you see, don't talk about it that much, with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who're not used to you, will be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you don't trust me, Miyo-{\i1}chan{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it. It's just that....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.80,0:04:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally there should be records of him if he achieved such innovative feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.60,0:04:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll research.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be an great feat by today's standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it different in past?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.04,0:04:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,For the crime of imitating birds, and creating a fuss,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He was arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His work was burned
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus Kiteretsu Sai wrote encyclopedias of his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.80,0:04:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was such a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can relate to emotions of Kiteretsu Sai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.85,0:05:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had evidence, I could surprise everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that there's no evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.70,0:05:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.83,0:05:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What is written in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.27,0:05:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.54,0:05:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.11,0:05:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing written in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He was arrested
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't an evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that it come to this, only way to prove that I'm Kiteretsu Sai's descendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to finish building this robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.93,0:05:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All done! Three weeks of hardship finally comes into fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I just have to press this switch to turn it on....
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Success!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you do that to your creator?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.39,0:06:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What was all that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.29,0:06:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what this box contains.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very dusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzuukyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.21,0:07:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.98,0:07:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So Kiteretsu Sai wore glasses, just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.65,0:07:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of rambling about ancestors! Studying is more important than inventions!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then and now geniuses aren't recognised.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.13,0:07:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.17,0:07:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
